# 🚀 Project Outcome

This project demonstrates the complete journey from **raw heterogeneous data to structured analytical data**.

The workflow combines:

**Data Profiling → Data Cleaning → Data Quality Checks → Feature Engineering → Aggregation → Data Modeling → Analytical Dataset Creation**

The final customer-level dataset brings together **financial metrics, risk classifications, transaction activity, and application-log behavior**, providing a foundation for further **business intelligence, dashboarding, customer analysis, and reporting**.

